verses.context:
>> Romans 5:1 Therefore, since we have been justified through faith, we have peace with God through our Lord Jesus Christ,
   Romans 5:2 through whom we have gained access by faith into this grace in which we stand. And we rejoice in the hope of the glory of God.
   Romans 5:3 Not only that, but we also rejoice in our sufferings, because we know that suffering produces perseverance;
